 F(1, IMP, "This code should print `[1 2 3]`, but it crashes. Fix the import.", 'import numpy\na = np.array([1, 2, 3])\nprint(a)', 'import numpy as np\na = np.array([1, 2, 3])\nprint(a)', "`np` only exists if you import NumPy with that short name: `import numpy as np`."),
